{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の京都！13th最後の全国握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のペアはまりっかこと伊藤万理華"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０歳おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも見えないよ‥。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目はこども。頭脳は大人！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のまりっかだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の頃食べるものがおじちゃんだったからまあやの携帯にはまりっかのことおっさんってかいて登録してるんだぁっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかのふぁんの皆様もまりっかみたいにオシャレで優しい人が多くてとっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な時間をありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次の日の個別握手会に来てくださった方！ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日続けて来てくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くから遠征できてくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの方やいつも来てくださる方\n初めましての方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島から来てくださった方が過去最高に多かったなぁと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"方言を聞いてとても懐かしく親近感があったよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんが今回のシングルで握手会最後っていうのがなんか寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん卒業が近づいてるんだなぁって、せいらりんの生誕祭をメイクさん達と端の方で見ていて思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業ライブ！絶対に成功させるから！せいらりんの最高の日！\n迎えれるようメンバーみんなで絶対作るからっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルでまいまいも卒業しちゃうね‥\nまだ想像もできないし実感もわかない‥\n結成からずっと一緒にやってきたから‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこうやってみんな卒業していくんだなぁって思った。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14thからも宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の『乃木の「の」』は、あみちゃんとまあやだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で普段な感じでやってきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！ではでは前回のブログで募集した質問を返していきます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな服のブランドは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スナイデル。ワンスポ。ダズリン。シークレットハニーとかかな？決まってはないなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モノマネする時に注意してることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事前に嫌じゃないかメンバーに確認する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦したい髪型は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミディアムヘアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲の良い二期生は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子！あやね！らんぜも妹みたいでかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子ファンどう思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会とかも女の子多くてすごく嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容のためにやっていること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脳を勘違いさせる！笑笑笑\n実際めっちゃ食べてるけど食べてないって言い聞かせてる‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味ないと思うけど。(･･;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段ヘアアレンジする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する！学校とかプライベートとかたまにするー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度カエルかイグアナの絵がある服着ていっていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気でやめてー！爬虫類ほんといやだからー(ﾟoﾟ;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になる春物アイテム、靴のサイズ好きな色は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レース系とか、春らしいパステルカラーとか肩が透けてるの気になる(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)\n靴は23.5か24！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅で注目してる子は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平手ちゃんとねるちゃんかわいいなぁ〜いつも思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな化粧品使ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"RMKとかシャネル、MACとかかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ男子どう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいと思う！！！\n普段コンタクトだけど夜メガネとかまあや的にキュン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に学校でも授業だけメガネかけてるとか！\nおにぃちゃん確かそれだわ！\nでもお兄ちゃんにキュンはないけど‥ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな靴が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩きやすいけど足がキレイに見えるの！笑\nあとお洋服に合わせやすい靴が好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ誕生日だよね？なんでもあげるっていったらなにほしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から使う生活用品‥笑\nかわいい雑貨とか？\nバスタオルとか、筆箱とか、リハ様にくるぶしソックスとか‥。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレなの！今お部屋の模様替えしてるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日1通もモバイルメールこないことってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全メンバーのしらないからよくわからないけどまあやは1日なるべく3、4通は送る様に心がけるけど忙しいと携帯触れなかったりするから‥人それぞれだと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの質問ありがとう♪また質問に答えますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0032.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌BUBKAとポップティーン発売中です\n٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ポップティーンは4月発売の5月号の方にも出させていただきましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非みてほしいですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も雑誌の撮影してきたのでまた、お知らせいたします〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくありがたい❤みんなのおかげです！感謝（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0034.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくお母さんにしてもらったことのある膝枕〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいな〜っておもっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではまたねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/03/02/2172794/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}